# Resume the saved native system. Recall HPCLANG from HOME and invoke PrRUN
# through the already installed ARMToolbox; do not transfer or reinstall it.
# Enter its name using the printed Alpha legends. New variables may move the
# application away from F1 in the VAR menu.
0 monitor 90000
1000 tap on
2000 chord alpha mode
3000 chord alpha letter_p
4000 chord alpha f3
5000 chord alpha nxt
6000 chord alpha f1
7000 chord alpha eval
8000 chord alpha files
9000 tap enter
11000 capture recalled-by-name
12000 chord rshift two
14500 tap f1
17000 tap f1
